        "blocksUi": "={\"attachments\":[{\"color\":\"#2eb886\",\"fallback\":\"memory read\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"section\",\"text\":{\"type\":\"mrkdwn\",\"text\":\":books:  *Memory read*\"}},{\"type\":\"section\",\"fields\":[{\"type\":\"mrkdwn\",\"text\":\"*Files*\\n`{{ $json.count }}`\"},{\"type\":\"mrkdwn\",\"text\":\"*Path*\\n`/vault/memory/`\"}]},{\"type\":\"section\",\"text\":{\"type\":\"mrkdwn\",\"text\":\"*Returned*\\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.files ?? '').slice(1,-1) }}\"}},{\"type\":\"context\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"mrkdwn\",\"text\":\"`memory_read`  ·  `briefing/` + `learned/`  ·  contents not logged\"}]}]}]}",
